---
import { textLink } from './linkClasses';
---

<section
  class="rounded-lg border border-galaxy-primary/10 bg-surface p-4 shadow-sm sm:p-8"
  aria-labelledby="galaxy-europe-intro"
>
  <div class="mb-3">
    <h2 id="galaxy-europe-intro" class="text-2xl font-bold text-fg-strong">Open, reproducible data analysis</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-fg-2">
      <strong>Galaxy</strong> is an <strong>open-source</strong> platform for
      <strong>
        <a class={textLink} href="https://www.go-fair.org/fair-principles/"> FAIR data analysis. </a>
      </strong
      >It gives researchers a graphical web interface for complex analysis while keeping workflows, histories, and
      results shareable and reproducible.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-fg-2">
      The <strong>Galaxy Community</strong> helps the ecosystem improve and supports researchers in sharing scientific
      discoveries.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ul class="grid gap-3 text-sm text-fg-2 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <li class="rounded-lg border border-galaxy-primary/10 bg-bay-of-many-50 p-4">
      <strong class="block text-fg-strong">Tools</strong>
      Run domain-specific tools through the web interface.
    </li>
    <li class="rounded-lg border border-galaxy-primary/10 bg-bay-of-many-50 p-4">
      <strong class="block text-fg-strong">Workflows</strong>
      Connect tools into reusable analysis workflows.
    </li>
    <li class="rounded-lg border border-galaxy-primary/10 bg-bay-of-many-50 p-4">
      <strong class="block text-fg-strong">Interactive environments</strong>
      Use RStudio, Jupyter, and companion tools.
    </li>
    <li class="rounded-lg border border-galaxy-primary/10 bg-bay-of-many-50 p-4">
      <strong class="block text-fg-strong">Reproducibility</strong>
      Capture the context needed to repeat analyses.
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>
